OL,3,GNEWSACounty council faces funding
OL,4,Ashortfall of #98m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Worcestershire County
OL,7,FCouncil has said the authority "is
OL,8,Falmost certainly" not going to increase
OL,9,Fcouncil tax by more than 5% next year
OL,10,Fdespite a funding shortfall now
OL,11,Festimated to be #98m.
OL,13,FMatt Jenkins, who also fronts the
OL,14,Fcounty's Green Party, drew the line at
OL,15,F5% in May, but during an interview with
OL,16,FBBC Hereford & Worcester on Monday he
OL,17,Faddmitted council finances were in "a
OL,18,Fdeep hole".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
