OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACounty council faces funding
OL,4,Ashortfall of #98m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked whether his position on tax was
OL,7,Funchanged, he stated: "I'm a
OL,8,Fpolitician, you make promises and it's
OL,9,Falways very dangerous but we really do
OL,10,Fnot want to increase council tax above
OL,11,F5%."
OL,13,FHe said: "We definitely don't want to
OL,14,Fdo that. We're almost certainly not
OL,15,Fgoing to do that."
